        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c12d7371-0dce-5135-ab49-ffb9a4a3ccb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series and Episodes: Body of Proof, Body of Proof season 2, Missing\n- People: Christopher Murphey, Jeri Ryan, Jeri Lynn Zimmermann, Nicholas Bishop, John Carroll Lynch, Sonja Sohn, Geoffrey Arend, Windell Middlebrooks\n- Roles and Characters: Dr. Kate Murphy, Peter Dunlop, Bud Morris, Samantha Baker, Dr. Ethan Gross, Dr. Curtis Brumfield, Seven of Nine\n\nFacts:\n- Jeri Lynn Ryan, born Jeri Lynn Zimmermann on February 22, 1968, is a German actress.\n- Jeri Ryan is best known for playing the Borg character Seven of Nine and was nominated four times for a Saturn Award, winning in 2001.\n- Body of Proof is an American television series created by Christopher Murphey.\n- The second season of Body of Proof began airing in the United States on September 20, 2011.\n- The second season of Body of Proof included 20 episodes.\n- Missing is the third episode of the second season of the American medical drama Body of Proof.\n- In Body of Proof season 2, Nicholas Bishop played Peter Dunlop, Jeri Ryan played Dr. Kate Murphy, John Carroll Lynch and Sonja Sohn played detectives Bud Morris and Samantha Baker, and Geoffrey Arend and Windell Middlebrooks played medical examiners Dr. Ethan Gross and Dr. Curtis Brumfield.\n- The second season of Body of Proof concluded on April 10, 2012.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
